WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:06.140
Day-of-week values need documentation In PostgreSQL
EXTRACT

00:00:06.153 --> 00:00:11.805
DOW uses zero for Sunday and six for Saturday Other
tools may use

00:00:11.831 --> 00:00:17.805
different conventions Whenever a numeric code
represents a temporal category

00:00:18.108 --> 00:00:21.371
document the mapping before using it in analysis or
modeling
